Third-party notices
===================

This plugin is an independent lightweight homage, not affiliated with or
endorsed by Anthropic or DeepSeek.

1. dsh-claude-style (skin look & design language)
   Copyright (c) 2026 Nwflower — MIT License
   https://github.com/Nwflower/dsh-claude-style
   The bundled skin (skins/claude-lite) is an independent lightweight CSS
   re-implementation of the look popularized by that plugin; its visual
   design language and token vocabulary informed this work. The vendor
   wordmark SVGs under lib/brand-marks/ were extracted from that package
   (lobe-icons lockups, MIT).

2. dsh-title-curator (session-title state machine)
   Copyright (c) 2026 dsh-title-curator contributors — MIT License
   https://github.com/chancecc99-gif/dsh-title-curator
   lib/host/title/ is based on that plugin (v0.1.2), including this fork's
   local patches, with category emojis made runtime-configurable.

3. oil-oil/oil-codex-title (naming rules origin)
   Copyright (c) 2026 oil — MIT License
   https://github.com/oil-oil/oil-codex-title
   The "category emoji + object｜goal" naming rules originate there.
   The MIT License text above applies to these projects' portions verbatim.

4. Fonts
   - JetBrains Mono (lib/fonts/JetBrainsMono*.ttf):
     Copyright 2020 The JetBrains Mono Project Authors, SIL Open Font
     License 1.1 — the full license text ships in lib/fonts/OFL.txt.
   - Inter (lib/fonts/InterVariable.woff2):
     Copyright The Inter Project Authors, SIL Open Font License 1.1
     (lib/fonts/OFL.txt).
   - Noto Serif (lib/fonts/NotoSerifVariable.woff2):
     Copyright 2014-2021 Google LLC, SIL Open Font License 1.1
     (lib/fonts/OFL.txt).
   - Anthropic typefaces (Anthropic Sans/Serif/Mono Web):
     Proprietary to Anthropic. They are NOT included in the distributed
     package and NOT covered by this license. Personal local installs may
     provide them separately; the package degrades gracefully to system
     fonts without them.
   - Vendor wordmarks (lib/brand-marks/): lobe-icons lockups extracted from
     dsh-claude-style; lobe-icons is MIT licensed. Brand names and logos
     remain trademarks of their respective owners, referenced for
     identification only.
